{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47802","headline":"留诗 · 李公佐仆","name":"留诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有衣中珠，不嫌衣上尘。\n我有长生理，不厌有生身。\n江南神仙窟，吾当混其真。\n不嫌市井諠，来救世间人。\n苏子迹已往，颛蒙事可亲。\n莫言东海变，天地有长春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李公佐仆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}